# Day 41/60 — AI Interactive Learning Studio

## Objective

Today I built an AI Interactive Learning Studio, an interactive web application that helps users learn through structured modules, quizzes, practical exercises, and progress tracking.

The goal was to create a more engaging learning experience where users actively participate instead of simply consuming information.

